      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Note:-\nreact creates 2 virtual DOM other than\n1 real DOM and whenever there's changes\nit does that in 2nd new VDOM and compare\nit to the 1st new VDOM and then update\nthe real DOM with those minimal changes\nand it uses diffing algorithm",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Note:-\nreact creates 2 virtual DOM other than\n1 real DOM and whenever there's changes\nit does that in 2nd new VDOM and compare\nit to the 1st new VDOM and then update\nthe real DOM with those minimal changes\nand it uses diffing algorithm"
    },
