      "versionNonce": 372297465,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "w7jDBXTtr0YxzJbt3TLRi",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1406.5520896894898,
      "y": 433.6497827724611,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 524.8046875,
      "height": 336,
      "seed": 2043280829,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776484198208,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "JSX Rules:\njsx can return only 1 element\n(we need to wrap all elements in 1 parent element )\n\neach tag must be close\n\nJSX expression\nwe cant use if-else,for loop,\nwe can only use map, ternary operator\ninstead of class attribute we need to use className\ninstead of for attribute we use htmlFor in <label>\nto give css we need to pass in the form of object\n(key value pair) camel case\ncomponent name should be Pascal case(Navbar omponent)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "JSX Rules:\njsx can return only 1 element\n(we need to wrap all elements in 1 parent element )\n\neach tag must be close\n\nJSX expression\nwe cant use if-else,for loop,\nwe can only use map, ternary operator\ninstead of class attribute we need to use className\ninstead of for attribute we use htmlFor in <label>\nto give css we need to pass in the form of object\n(key value pair) camel case\ncomponent name should be Pascal case(Navbar omponent)"
    },
